{{Quote|The chair recognizes the senator from the sovereign system of Naboo.|[[Finis Valorum]]|<ref name="Episode I">{{Film|I}}</ref>}}
The '''Naboo system''' was a [[Star system|solar system]] of the [[Chommell sector]], in [[the galaxy]]'s [[Mid Rim Territories|Mid Rim]]. It notably contained the pastoral [[planet]] of [[Naboo]].<ref name="Ultimate SW" /> In the last decades of the [[Galactic Republic]], it was represented in the [[Galactic Senate]] by [[Darth Sidious|Sheev Palpatine]],<ref name="Episode I" /> and then [[Padmé Amidala Naberrie|Padmé Amidala]].<ref name="Episode II">{{Film|II}}</ref>

{{System-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
''[[Rise of the Separatists]]'' lists the three moons of Naboo as [[Ohma-D'un]], [[Rori]], and [[Veruna]].<ref name="Rise" /> However, [[Claudia Gray]]'s novel ''[[Leia, Princess of Alderaan]]'' featured a moon of Naboo called [[Onoam]].<ref name="Leia" />

